  "report_week": "23",
  "report_period": "Week 23 (2nd Jun to 9th Jun 2023)",
  "commentary": {
    "bulkers": "Chinese owners have committed the Capesize \"Heruz Zhoushan\" 181/2017 SWS, China (SS 09/2027, DD 01/2026, BWTS fitted) to Greek interests for USD 41,5 mill basis delivery July-November 2023. The Ultramax \"Belvedere\" 66/2015 Mitsui, Japan (SS 09/2025, DD 01/2024, BWTS fitted) from Belships was committed to undisclosed buyers for excess USD 27 mill basis delivery Q3 2023. Remind you that the sister vessel \"Bulk Electra\" 66/2015 Mitsui, Japan (SS 12/2025, DD 11/2023, BWTS fitted) was sold a month ago at USD 27,2 mill. On the Supramax sector, Murakami Sekiyu sold their \"Nord Treasure\" 55/2014 Mitsui, Japan (SS/DD 07/2024, BWTS fitted) for mid-high USD 21 mill. For reference, the one-year-older \"New Beginning\" 56/2013 Mitsui, Japan (SS 01/2028, DD 02/2026, BWTS fitted) was sold back in March at USD 20,5 mill. The OHBS Handysize \"Cielo Di Palermo\" 37/2013 Saiki, Japan (SS 08/2027, DD 08/2025, BWTS fitted) of Nissen Kaiun was committed for USD 18,5 mill. Note that a month ago, the two-years-younger sister vessel \"Maestro Diamond\" 37/2015 Saiki, Japan (SS 05/2025, DD 05/2023) was sold at USD 22,5 mill. In addition, the conventional \"Seastar Endurance\" 34/2011 Zhejiang, China (SS 09/2026, DD 10/2024, BWTS fitted) was sold to European interests for mid-high 11 mill.",
    "tankers": "Following the sale of the LR1 \"Gulf Crystal\" 75/2009 Hyundai Mipo, Korea (SS/DD 11/2024, BWTS fitted) at USD 29,5 mill, Gulf Energy Maritime have now committed the sister vessel \"Gulf Coral\" 75/2009 Hyundai Mipo, Korea (SS/DD 09/2024) for USD 28,5 mill. Moreover, Prime Marine Management sold their \"Golden Shiner\" 75/2007 Onomichi, Japan (SS 01/2027, DD 01/2024, BWTS & Scrubber fitted), the sister \"Lake Sturgeon\" 75/2007 Onomichi, Japan (SS 01/2027, DD 05/2025, BWTS fitted) and the \"Bowfin\" 75/2008 Minami-Nippon, Japan (SS/DD 10/2023, BWTS fitted) for USD 79 mill enbloc. Super Shipping have committed their MR2 \"Super Ruby\" 50/2006 Shina, Korea (SS 02/2026, DD 09/2024, BWTS fitted) to undisclosed buyers for USD 20,9 mill. For reference, the one-year-older sister vessel \"Neutron Ray\" 50/2005 Shina, Korea (SS/DD 03/2025, BWTS fitted) was sold back in March at USD 18,1 mill.",
    "freight": {
      "Capesize": "at the level of mid usd 8,00's fio range. No period activity to report here.",
      "Kamsarmax / Panamax": "North Pacific rounds ranged at the usd 9,000/11,000 pd. A number of Indonesian and Australian trips into China were reported fixed at the usd 7,000/10,000 pd range. A number of Indonesian and Australian trips into India were fixed around usd 9,000/10,000 pd. South East Asian trips via East Coast South America into China were reported at the level of usd 11,000/13,000 pd. Continental trips via US Gulf into India were fixed around usd 21,000/22,000 pd. South American trips into China were reported at the level of usd 13,000/16,000 pd plus ballast bonus at the usd 350K/600K. A Kamsarmax was fixed on period at the usd 15,250 pd basis delivery China for 1 year employment.",
      "Ultramax / Supramax": "North Pacific rounds ranged at the usd 7,000/8,000 pd. A number of Indonesian trips into China were fixed around usd 4,000/6,000 pd. Trips from Philippines into China with nickel ore were reported at the level of usd 7,000 pd. Australian trips into China were fixed around usd 7,000/8,000 pd. South East Asian trips into US Gulf with cement were reported at the level of usd 5,000/6,000 pd. Mediterranean trips inti US East Coast were fixed around usd 9,000/11,000 pd. No period activity to report here.",
      "Handymax / Handysize": "A number of trips from China via Japan into Continent were fixed around usd 10,000/12,000 pd. Australian trips into China were reported at the level of usd 10,000/11,000 pd. Australian trips into India were fixed around usd 10,000/12,000 pd. Mediterranean trips via Red Sea into India with phosrock were reported at the level of usd 6,000/8,000 pd. US Gulf trips into Mediterranean were fixed around usd 10,000/11,000 pd. No period activity to report here."
    }
  },
